  "id": "quinoa-stuffed-bell-peppers",
  "name": "Quinoa-Stuffed Bell Peppers",
  "subtitle": "Vegetable-filled peppers with melted mozzarella",
  "description": "Tender bell peppers filled with quinoa, tomato sauce, and sautéed vegetables, then finished with melted mozzarella.",
